# Resources

Listed here are links to credible and reliable places and libraries to aid in
command/datapack support and creation.

:::note

This wiki is run by Datapack Hub. We aren't responsible for the content on
external sites or Discord Servers, so proceed with caution. However, they're all
safe to use and have amazingly useful content and tools for creating Minecraft
Datapacks.

:::

